      "content": "idk i feel like he's just tired from the sickness. if i give him a big bottle of pedialyte or even just a little bit of Gatorade right now, wouldn't that be basically the same thing as the iv fluids you're talking about? like, can't i just try to get some fluids in him at home for an hour or two and then decide? i'm just so scared of the hospital.",
